WEBVTT

00:01:59.907 --> 00:02:04.579
And what we're finding
is that young adults are stuck

00:02:04.620 --> 00:02:07.874
between adolescence and adulthood.

00:02:08.749 --> 00:02:11.919
And that's the generation
of people that we're raising.

00:02:12.753 --> 00:02:14.046
And in fact,

00:02:14.088 --> 00:02:18.092
we hear this in the language
that young adults even use

00:02:18.134 --> 00:02:21.679
when they have to make
responsible adult decisions.

00:02:21.679 --> 00:02:22.847
There's a term for it.

00:02:22.889 --> 00:02:24.390
Who knows what that is?

00:02:24.974 --> 00:02:26.642
Adulting, yes.

00:02:26.642 --> 00:02:28.769
The practice of behaving

00:02:28.811 --> 00:02:32.690
in a characteristic
of a responsible adult.